WEBVTT

00:00:00.608 --> 00:00:01.346
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.266 --> 00:00:07.288
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> ‘I’m sorry, but I don’t love you.’

00:00:09.297 --> 00:00:09.995
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:10.908 --> 00:00:13.108
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> ‘Give me back all my letters.’

00:00:14.942 --> 00:00:15.798
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:20.244
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> ‘I think…I have an idea.’

00:00:22.182 --> 00:00:22.945
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.739 --> 00:00:25.853
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> ‘Don’t make a noise.

00:00:26.376 --> 00:00:27.959
Everyone is asleep.’

00:00:30.136 --> 00:00:31.007
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:34.995
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> ‘I don’t feel like doing anything.’

00:00:36.907 --> 00:00:37.787
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:38.617 --> 00:00:40.866
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> ‘This is a very important matter.’